Details of actions

1. Trigger: When a new email arrives in a shared mailbox (V2)
Runs every 1 minute (recurrence).
Mailbox: micurtailment@Cenlar.com.
Includes attachments.
Monitors a specific folder (Inbox, by folderId).
Splits on each email (processes each message individually).
2. Initialize_variable
Type: InitializeVariable.
Variable Name: cleanSubject (string).
Value: The subject of the email, with "RE: ", "FW: ", and "FWD: " removed using nested replace functions.
3. Initialize_variable_1
Type: InitializeVariable.
Variable Name: internetId (string).
Value: The email’s internetMessageId (unique identifier for the message).
4. Initialize_variable_2
Type: InitializeVariable.
Variable Name: conversationId (string).
Value: The email’s conversationId (identifier for the email thread/conversation).
5. Html_to_text
Type: OpenApiConnection (Conversion Service).
Input: The email body (HTML) is wrapped in a paragraph tag.
Action: Converts the HTML content of the email body to plain text.
6. Run_a_prompt
Type: OpenApiConnection (AI Builder).
Input: The plain text email body.
Prompt: Asks AI to extract:
Is_Spam: Boolean (true if out-of-office, newsletter, or login code).
Loan_Number: String (null if not found).
Extracted_Date: String (due date if found, else null).
Sentiment: String (Routine Request, Frustrated Follow-up, or Escalation/Penalty Threat).
Financial_Risk: Boolean (true if claim denial/curtailment threats).
Returns: JSON object with the above keys.
7. Condition (If)
Type: If control.
Expression: Checks if the email matches any of these:
Subject contains: "out of office", "automatic reply", "security code", "verification code", "(OTP)", "Arch MI Verification Code", "MI Online Security Code".
Body contains: "if you wish to unsubscribe", "security code", "password reset", "opted-in".
ToRecipients contains: "micurtailment@cenlar.com".
From equals: several specific email addresses (e.g., wrlevengood@cenlar.com, mpusdesris1@cenlar.com, etc.).
If True:
Terminate: Ends the flow with status "Succeeded".
If False:
Proceeds to the next action.
8. Create_item
Type: OpenApiConnection (SharePoint).
Creates a new item in the SharePoint list at https://cenlarfsb.sharepoint.com/sites/DfltMgr/Claims.
Fields populated:
Title: cleanSubject variable.
Status/Value: "New".
RequesterEmail: Email sender.
Description: Output from Html_to_text (plain text body).
ReceivedTime: Email receivedDateTime.
ConversationId: conversationId variable.
InternetMessageId: internetId variable.
Source: "Email".
